{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gerrymap is a game about gerrymandering. Your goal is to draw the maximum amount of districts where your voters are in the majority, utilizing real census and election data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, the Supreme Court and Justice Department have made new, onerous requirements for us to follow. First they made it so city slickers get proportional representation. Now we need &quot;minority opportunity districts&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are serious obstacles for us to keep or even expand our majority going into 1992. But perhaps you can do it better than they did in real life?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120690?t=1762000653","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120690?t=1762000653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120690/57d6b2befe5b12c37d1a4f5592ccf3f111c84154/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762000653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120690/57d6b2befe5b12c37d1a4f5592ccf3f111c84154/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762000653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gerrymap is a game about gerrymandering. Your goal is to draw the maximum amount of districts where your voters are in the majority, utilizing real census and election data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, the Supreme Court and Justice Department have made new, onerous requirements for us to follow. First they made it so city slickers get proportional representation. Now we need &quot;minority opportunity districts&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are serious obstacles for us to keep or even expand our majority going into 1992. But perhaps you can do it better than they did in real life?</p>","developers":["Gideon Kennedy"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120690/d1b7a5916eb0685896559735d5189cb118f4dfa7/header.jpg?t=1762000653","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Gerrymap","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Pentium 4<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> ATI X1300<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Gideon Kennedy"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"17 Nov, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120690/7b30ce5add59f384456b9c253717a905261e6401/ss_7b30ce5add59f384456b9c253717a905261e6401.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762000653","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120690/7b30ce5add59f384456b9c253717a905261e6401/ss_7b30ce5add59f384456b9c253717a905261e6401.600x338.jpg?t=1762000653"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120690/d49b2c2fb23345d3f59915d0ba260188e065f4af/ss_d49b2c2fb23345d3f